Hi Sandra,

depending on your objective, you can also insert "moderator.a := a2 - a1" and/or moderator.b := b2 - b1". About the problem with the bootstrap: To be honest, I don't immediately see where the problem lies (maybe someone else will notice it?). However, there are a few facets that seem strange to me: (1) Your DV is “ART_Adherence” according to the model specification, but you pass the argument ordered = “TRT_Ad ”. I can't find "TRT_Ad" in the syntax. The error message refers to “totanxscore~inter_latent”. I can't find that in your syntax either.  There I only find “totdp ~ c(a1,a2)*Ints”. Something seems strange here. In the very first step, I would look at what R has actually stored in the "modmediated_lv2" object: cat(modmediated_lv2).

HTH

Christian

